Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.51,0:05:30.14,Signs,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1025,853)\c&HFBFCFF&\pos(342,116)\fnArial MT Std Medium}「 To Santa Claus 」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:18.46,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.46,0:00:19.64,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.64,0:00:23.37,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What present would you like Santa Claus to bring you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:29.36,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't thought about it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.25,0:00:36.99,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,He won't make it if you don't think of something quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.99,0:00:38.82,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,He's coming from really far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.66,0:00:42.73,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.97,0:00:47.22,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Let's hear it. What do you want the most now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.28,0:00:50.55,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A Lob Ear. {http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lop_ear}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.55,0:00:52.19,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What? Don't you already have that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.63,0:00:54.65,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,She wants friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.71,0:01:09.06,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.06,0:01:12.09,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for coming so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.09,0:01:14.29,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.29,0:01:15.68,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.17,0:01:21.59,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.85,0:01:24.46,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This is a Christmas tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.23,0:01:29.70,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.70,0:01:33.01,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well... some stuff from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.03,0:01:43.09,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Let's put up the tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.72,0:02:02.85,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up! Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.85,0:02:04.44,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Coming~!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.07,0:02:10.89,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This one goes on the top?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.89,0:02:12.10,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.88,0:02:25.54,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.45,0:02:30.00,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Our house doesn't have a chimney.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.61,0:02:34.32,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Santa Claus will have his own way of getting in,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:35.96,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,so don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.94,0:02:41.17,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll unlock the door then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.17,0:02:42.64,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No need for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.06,0:02:57.30,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's with that carrot?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.30,0:02:59.03,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's for Mr. Reindeer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.47,0:03:14.38,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm switching off the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:16.48,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A little while more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.48,0:03:19.51,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Santa Claus won't come unless you go to sleep.{Santa Claus only send presents to children who go to sleep.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.51,0:03:21.93,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What?! Hurry and turn off the lights!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.16,0:03:26.36,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.69,0:04:56.74,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to meet Santa Claus, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.52,0:05:03.25,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, time to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.25,0:05:04.71,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,OK~!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.47,0:05:21.59,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks to Mr. Reindeer too.
